{"v":2,"voice":"ziggy-v2","locale":"fr","story":"d03","segments":{"title":{"file":"title.mp3","dur":2.83,"text":"Le lapin et le vase de la lune","words":[0.12,0.425,0.925,1.025,1.2,1.5,1.625,1.85],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.275,"grin"],[0.525,"open"],[0.625,"small"],[0.7,"smile"],[0.775,"grin"],[1.225,"small"],[1.275,"smile"],[1.35,"open"],[1.425,"grin"],[1.725,"open"],[1.875,"grin"],[1.95,"smile"],[2.05,"o"],[2.175,"grin"],[2.355,"smile"]]},"s1":{"file":"s1.mp3","dur":22.91,"text":"Au bord d’un pré, dans un terrier tout rond, vivait Pompon, un petit lapin gris aux grandes oreilles. Il portait toujours une salopette bleue. Sur la cheminée de sa grand-mère trônait un trésor : le vase de la lune. Il était bleu pâle, avec une lune d’argent peinte dessus. Le soir, il brillait doucement.","words":[0.12,0.42,0.77,1.045,1.52,1.77,1.945,2.445,2.695,3.245,3.62,4.47,4.645,5.02,5.495,5.795,5.895,6.295,7.44,7.705,8.18,8.73,8.905,9.555,10.43,10.745,10.995,11.52,11.67,11.87,12.545,13.02,13.145,14.095,14.095,14.32,14.62,14.72,14.895,15.92,16.17,16.395,16.72,17.52,17.795,17.97,18.22,18.72,19.02,20.28,20.66,21.16,21.385,21.76],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.27,"o"],[0.445,"small"],[0.52,"smile"],[0.62,"o"],[0.695,"grin"],[0.87,"o"],[1.07,"small"],[1.195,"smile"],[1.27,"grin"],[1.42,"smile"],[1.545,"grin"],[1.595,"open"],[1.72,"grin"],[1.795,"o"],[1.97,"grin"],[2.545,"o"],[2.72,"grin"],[2.77,"smile"],[2.845,"o"],[2.92,"smile"],[3.27,"small"],[3.345,"grin"],[3.445,"small"],[3.52,"grin"],[3.645,"small"],[3.72,"o"],[3.795,"smile"],[3.92,"small"],[3.995,"smile"],[4.07,"o"],[4.145,"smile"],[4.495,"o"],[4.67,"small"],[4.745,"grin"],[5.12,"open"],[5.22,"small"],[5.345,"grin"],[5.645,"smile"],[5.72,"grin"],[5.82,"o"],[5.92,"grin"],[6.07,"open"],[6.17,"grin"],[6.32,"o"],[6.42,"grin"],[6.495,"smile"],[6.62,"grin"],[6.925,"smile"],[7.53,"grin"],[7.78,"o"],[7.855,"grin"],[8.28,"o"],[8.405,"grin"],[8.48,"smile"],[8.555,"o"],[8.63,"grin"],[8.755,"o"],[8.805,"grin"],[9.005,"open"],[9.08,"grin"],[9.15